Description: Boswas OS Control Plane (device management server)
 The management server for Boswas OS devices, for a dedicated server (it is
 not installed on devices):
 .
  * device registry: enrollment with one-time tokens and a device CA, mutual
    TLS, heartbeats, inventory, posture and connection state
  * typed management commands (install, update, remove, launch, stop,
    repair Windows applications; refresh inventory; apply policy; update the
    agent) with a full lifecycle, expiry and idempotency; no remote shell
  * signed, versioned device policies (Ed25519)
  * an application catalog of 64-bit Windows applications with stored
    installers; 32-bit entries are marked unsupported and never installed
  * a hash-chained audit trail and a web dashboard
 .
 Python standard library with SQLite storage.
